{
  "page": 578,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5571,
      "text": "No indeed! You [people] love this fleeting world,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5572,
      "text": "and neglect the Hereafter.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5573,
      "text": "On that Day some faces will be bright,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5574,
      "text": "looking at their Lord[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5575,
      "text": "And on that Day, some faces will be gloomy,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5576,
      "text": "knowing that a crushing calamity will befall them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5577,
      "text": "Indeed, when the soul reaches the throat[8],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5578,
      "text": "and it is said, “Is there any healer?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5579,
      "text": "And he realizes that it is time to depart,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5580,
      "text": "when legs are brought together [in a shroud][9];",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5581,
      "text": "on that Day, he will be driven to your Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5582,
      "text": "He neither believed nor prayed;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5583,
      "text": "rather he denied and turned away,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5584,
      "text": "then he went to his people, elated with pride,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5585,
      "text": "Woe to you, and woe!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5586,
      "text": "Again, woe to you, and woe!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5587,
      "text": "Does man think that he will be left neglected[10]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5588,
      "text": "Was he not once a drop of semen emitted,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5589,
      "text": "then he became a clinging clot[11], then He created him and perfected his form,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5590,
      "text": "and made from him both genders, male and female?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5591,
      "text": "Is not He able to bring the dead back to life?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 513,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5592,
      "text": "Was there not a period of time when man was not a thing [even] mentioned[1]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5593,
      "text": "Indeed, We created man from a drop of mixed fluids[2], in order to test him. So We gave him hearing and sight.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5594,
      "text": "Indeed, We showed him the way, whether he is grateful or ungrateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5595,
      "text": "We have surely prepared for the disbelievers chains, shackles, and a Blazing Fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5596,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will drink from a cup [of wine] flavored with camphor[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 76,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِنسَانِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Insaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Man",
        "numberOfAyahs": 31,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 578,
      "ruku": 514,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
